{"last_link_id": 30, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## Models\n\nWill be downloaded on the first run, or download them manually and place them into the directory: /models/tts/VibeVoice\n\n| Model | Context Length | Generation Length |  Weight |\n|-------|----------------|----------|----------|\n| VibeVoice-0.5B-Streaming | - | - | On the way |\n| VibeVoice-1.5B | 64K | ~90 min | [HF link](https://huggingface.co/microsoft/VibeVoice-1.5B) |\n| VibeVoice-Large| 32K | ~45 min | [HF link](https://huggingface.co/microsoft/VibeVoice-Large) |"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Notes", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [420, 210], "pos": [-1030, -960], "id": 10, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 112], "pos": [-965.3587646484375, -1144.5135498046875], "widgets_values": ["audio/VibeVoice"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 27, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true, "audioUI": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [27], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["VibeVoice-Large", "Speaker 1: 来者可是诸葛孔明？\n\nSpeaker 2: 正是。\n\nSpeaker 1: 久闻公之大名，今日有幸相会。公既知天命、识时务，为何兴无名之师，犯我疆界？\n\nSpeaker 2: 我奉诏讨贼，何谓之无名？\n\nSpeaker 1: 天数有变，神器更易，归有德之人，此乃自然之理。曹魏承天命，顺人心。公若倒戈卸甲，以礼来降，仍不失封侯之位